tiny yet powerfull html viewer made for my miniweb browser chain, which contains programs like

1. viewer
    minimal html viewer writen in python
2. mwd
    tiny web downloader helper, short for minimal Web downloader

extra files that arnt important

1. test.py          - test new versions of the code
2. out.txt          - paste terminal's output into for debugging

how the minimal web works

1. mwd executes
    curl {http} -o cache.html

    which makes a file named cache.html

2. viewer
    A. opens cache.html and puts containents into a string
    B. executes a simple loop
        1. small delay to make efficent
        2. gets current key
        3. prints top bar
        4. print cache.html 's containents to screen

        5. inputs
            A. q. quits
            B. r. refreshes page
            C. s. search url / duck duck go engine
                duck duck go isnt working yet, its flagging this as bots
            D. h. home page, links to some good websites for this
